  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Household Resilience in South Lebanon: Targeted Cash Assistance &amp; Child Protection Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project to address urgent needs and provide child protection services for vulnerable populations, including Syrian refugees in southern Lebanon. The main activities include multi-purpose cash assistance for vulnerable households, capacity building for child protection workers, and provision of community-based psychosocial support for children and caregivers. Awareness activities on child protection will be conducted at the community level, and child-friendly spaces will be renovated and equipped to support with necessary supplies.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Households with children, including those with disabilities are better able to meet their and their children&apos;s basic needs&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xb0b4; &#xc544;&#xb3d9;&#xc774; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xcde8;&#xc57d; &#xac00;&#xad6c;&#xc758; &#xd544;&#xc218;&#xc801;&#xc778; &#xd544;&#xc694; &#xcda9;&#xc871; &#xbc0f; &#xc544;&#xb3d9; &#xbcf4;&#xd638; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
  </description>
